CampusCoffeeService

agents:
humans: Professor: busy, tired
Student: sick, tired
robots: CoffeeRobot: coffeeMaker
locations: BuildingRoom: inside
BuildingRoomB: inside
BuildingRoomC: inside
resources: Coffee: properties: quantity (unit: cups); color (enum: black, white); temperature (unit: degree Celsius)

Nurse:
default: moveTo BuildingRoom
else: stop
1: moveTo BuildingRoomB
2: if CoffeeRobot.coins < 5 then stop else moveTo coffeeMachine
3: if !CoffeeRobot.primaries[0].function = 'coffeeMaker' then stop else fetch Coffee from vending machine
4: if !CoffeeRobot.primaries[0].function = 'coffeeMaker' then stop else coffeeMachine
5: if !SickProfessor.has_products[0] = 'ReadyToDrink' then stop else follow Student
6: deposit Coffee in SickProfessor.location
7: leave SickProfessor
8: pick Coffee at SickProfessor.location

success: !SickProfessor.has_products[0] = 'ReadyToDrink'
failure: Coffee.contains('.') != true

Campus = CampusCoffeeService
Professor = Professor
Student = Student
Container = CoffeeRobot.primaries[0]
Machine = coffeeMachine
location = BuildingRoomC
